iation is running ads tying Hull to President Trump. Barack Obama endorsed her in early October. Rating outlets overwhelmingly call the race Solid or Likely Democratic, with one at Lean Democratic, and prediction markets put her chances in the mid-90s. Hull's plan to phase out the state income tax offers a contrast, but his lean war chest limits his ability to sell it.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 10.58}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9605, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.948, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9415, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9552, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9606, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9549, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9273, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9256, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9268, "margin": 8.5}]}